Package: RTMR
Title: Risk Terrain Modeling in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kevin", "Hu", , "kevin.hu@bccdc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0254-5277"))
Description: Replicates the major modeling functionality of the Risk Terrain
    Modeling Diagnostics (RTMDx) Utility in R. Risk factors are
    operationalized as binary proximity or kernel-density variables at a
    range of spatial influences on a grid of cells, culled with a
    cross-validated penalized Poisson regression, and selected by
    bidirectional stepwise regression on BIC under Poisson and negative
    binomial models. Outputs include relative risk values for the selected
    factors and a relative risk score for each grid cell.
